WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Before directing the vehicle, confirm the route is clear and the driver can see you.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Raise both arms, orient your palms as shown in the reference, and repeatedly bend your

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
arms toward your head and chest. Stop immediately if visual contact is lost.

